  "blurb": "A limited collection of contemporary tropical villas on Maenam Soi 1 — a five-minute walk from the sand of Maenam Beach. Each home pairs open-plan living with a private pool and garden, available as five bedrooms or four-plus-office. Freehold or leasehold, off-plan, from ฿18.9M — or ฿20.4M with the optional furniture package.",
  "detail": "An exclusive enclave of only a handful of contemporary villas on Maenam Soi 1, set along Koh Samui's quieter north coast just a five-minute walk from the pristine sand of Maenam Beach. The position balances privacy and convenience — close to shops, restaurants and international schools, and within easy reach of Fisherman's Village and Bophut — while staying wrapped in tropical calm.\n\nEach villa is composed for effortless island living: open-plan living and dining that flow seamlessly indoors to out, a private swimming pool and garden, and high-quality finishes throughout in a clean, contemporary tropical architecture built for durability. Homes are configured as five bedrooms, or four bedrooms plus a dedicated office, across roughly 443 m² of built area on plots from 403 m².\n\nVillas are delivered complete with curated interior design, premium materials and appliances. An optional furniture package is offered on top: ฿18,900,000 without furniture, or ฿20,400,000 fully furnished — so the home can be handed over move-in ready, or left open for your own interiors.\n\nOwnership is flexible: villas can be taken freehold or leasehold. The leasehold structure carries no yearly lease fee — the only cost at renewal is the legal fee to register the extension. Together with strong rental demand in Maenam and optional management for owners, the villas suit a holiday home, a full-time residence or a rental investment. Offered off-plan, from ฿18,900,000.",
